  "key_findings": "SPY-GLD tail dependence analysis (2005-2026): Copula-GARCH reveals the non-linear dependence structure. Full-sample best copula selected by AIC/BIC. Rolling 500-day window shows time-varying tail dependence. Crisis periods (GFC, COVID, 2022 rate hikes) analyzed separately. Copula VaR backtested with Kupiec + Christoffersen + Basel trinity for both IS and OOS periods. Key question: does lower tail dependence exist (diversification breakdown) or is it near zero (50/50 moat intact)?",
